WEBVTT

01:49.800 --> 01:50.600
What are you doing?

01:51.640 --> 01:52.320
Close your eyes.

01:52.960 --> 01:53.759
Do it now.

02:03.400 --> 02:04.160
Take a deep breath.

02:07.360 --> 02:08.080
Listen.

02:09.479 --> 02:10.240
What can you hear?

02:42.079 --> 02:42.960
The world

02:43.760 --> 02:45.000
has all kinds of sounds every day.

02:46.120 --> 02:47.120
Even if you cover your ears,

02:47.800 --> 02:49.240
they still find their way in.

02:50.840 --> 02:52.480
But they're like clouds in the sky,

02:53.880 --> 02:54.600
a gust of wind

02:55.840 --> 02:56.600
and they'll clear away,

02:57.400 --> 02:58.320
and the sky will turn bright again.

03:03.480 --> 03:04.120
Ye,

03:05.680 --> 03:06.480
adult matters

03:07.720 --> 03:08.520
are not your fault.

03:21.720 --> 03:22.880
The Ye I know

03:23.880 --> 03:25.320
is upright

03:25.920 --> 03:27.200
and fearless.

03:37.920 --> 03:38.560
Thank you.

03:42.440 --> 03:43.120
You're right.

03:44.040 --> 03:44.960
This little thing

03:45.240 --> 03:46.400
can't beat me.

03:47.760 --> 03:49.040
All rumors

03:51.000 --> 03:52.079
will fall apart on their own.

03:53.200 --> 03:53.880
Of course.

04:00.240 --> 04:00.840
Eat up.

04:34.520 --> 04:35.320
Eat.

04:36.000 --> 04:37.320
Finish and I'll take you somewhere.

04:39.480 --> 04:40.320
Where?

04:41.200 --> 04:42.200
You'll see.

04:53.080 --> 04:53.840
What's wrong?

04:58.040 --> 04:59.000
Why did you say

04:59.120 --> 05:00.600
that Qing Ye bullied me and Li Wenhui?

05:01.600 --> 05:03.200
I was just standing up for you.

05:03.840 --> 05:04.760
I only used

05:04.760 --> 05:05.640
the wrong word.

05:05.800 --> 05:07.040
And you didn't exactly

05:07.040 --> 05:08.120
come out ahead anyway.

05:08.640 --> 05:10.120
Should I have said

05:10.160 --> 05:10.960
you bullied her instead?

05:11.160 --> 05:12.920
We were helping you.

05:13.680 --> 05:15.160
I never asked you to.

05:15.200 --> 05:16.520
What do you mean?

05:16.800 --> 05:17.680
Trying to dump the blame

05:17.760 --> 05:19.040
on me now?

05:20.560 --> 05:21.200
Fang Lei.

05:21.880 --> 05:23.400
How can you think that of me?

05:23.560 --> 05:24.800
I only told you the truth

05:24.840 --> 05:25.960
because I trusted you most.

05:26.160 --> 05:27.480
You think I'm stupid?

05:27.920 --> 05:28.800
I know

05:28.880 --> 05:30.320
that post was you.

05:31.360 --> 05:32.400
What does that have to do with me?

05:33.520 --> 05:34.680
Then you must've forgotten

05:35.159 --> 05:36.720
the teddy bear on your forum avatar

05:37.080 --> 05:38.320
was a gift from me.

05:41.120 --> 05:42.320
You saw wrong.

05:43.000 --> 05:44.120
How could it be me?

05:48.000 --> 05:48.680
Don't worry.

05:49.200 --> 05:50.680
I won't tell anyone.

05:51.400 --> 05:52.320
But this is the last thing

05:52.360 --> 05:53.320
I'll do for you.

05:54.640 --> 05:55.600
From now on,

05:56.920 --> 05:58.200
I don't have a friend like you.

06:10.400 --> 06:11.720
With the Sea Goddess as witness,

06:12.480 --> 06:13.000
it will carry

06:13.040 --> 06:14.160
your thoughts of your mother

06:14.600 --> 06:15.480
on the wind.

06:16.640 --> 06:17.600
Old-fashioned it is,

06:18.720 --> 06:19.760
but thanks anyway.

06:45.240 --> 06:46.040
Do you think

06:47.159 --> 06:48.920
Mom will receive this lantern?

06:50.320 --> 06:51.159
Probably not.

06:52.840 --> 06:54.400
Then why did you sound so sure

06:54.520 --> 06:56.159
about the Sea Goddess as witness?

06:56.840 --> 06:58.040
That was just what I hoped.

06:58.600 --> 07:00.480
In reality, one is in the sky,

07:00.840 --> 07:01.600
the other in the sea,

07:02.080 --> 07:03.360
probably not the same system.

07:05.160 --> 07:06.360
Then what if we ignore all that?

07:06.600 --> 07:07.480
Still no.

07:09.240 --> 07:10.320
It won't fly for long

07:11.160 --> 07:12.080
before it falls.

07:15.400 --> 07:15.920
Can't you

07:15.920 --> 07:17.200
be a bit more romantic?

07:20.440 --> 07:22.040
Even if she doesn't receive the lantern,

07:22.760 --> 07:23.480
she will

07:23.760 --> 07:25.240
receive your thoughts.

07:27.040 --> 07:28.320
Your longing for your mother

07:28.920 --> 07:29.880
will cross the sea

07:31.040 --> 07:32.200
and be carried by time.

07:34.040 --> 07:35.320
Who taught you

07:35.960 --> 07:37.040
to talk like that?

07:38.080 --> 07:38.600
A philosopher,

07:38.840 --> 07:39.640
Zhou Guimei.

07:51.880 --> 07:52.440
[Hello?]

07:53.440 --> 07:54.040
Hello.

07:56.040 --> 07:57.000
Is Qing Ye

07:57.520 --> 07:58.159
doing alright?

07:59.400 --> 08:00.040
[She's fine.]

08:00.320 --> 08:01.040
Good.

08:01.800 --> 08:02.920
I'll help you

08:03.080 --> 08:03.760
set up another time

08:03.760 --> 08:04.600
with Mr. Ye.

08:05.080 --> 08:05.600
[Thanks.]

08:11.000 --> 08:11.680
"Thanks."

08:45.880 --> 08:46.840
Have some watermelon.

08:47.320 --> 08:48.480
It's really sweet.

08:57.800 --> 08:58.920
Finish it and forget everything.

08:59.640 --> 09:00.600
Get a good night's sleep.

09:01.320 --> 09:02.840
Tomorrow it'll all be over.

09:07.720 --> 09:08.640
It's not over yet.

09:10.320 --> 09:11.800
If dealing with rumors means

09:12.040 --> 09:13.520
waiting for the liar to shut up,

09:14.160 --> 09:15.520
that's not fair.

09:19.920 --> 09:20.760
What do you want to do?

09:21.520 --> 09:22.880
I want an eye for an eye.

09:26.000 --> 09:26.560
Alright.

09:27.640 --> 09:28.480
Need my help?

09:29.320 --> 09:29.840
No.

09:30.760 --> 09:32.320
I'll bring this

09:32.400 --> 09:33.400
to an end myself.

09:35.600 --> 09:37.120
If you need help,

09:37.360 --> 09:38.040
just say it anytime.

09:39.440 --> 09:40.320
I'm heading to Shunyi.

09:43.560 --> 09:44.160
Good night.

09:44.560 --> 09:45.200
Good night.

12:34.200 --> 12:35.040
Auntie,

12:35.640 --> 12:36.320
where's Wu?

12:36.600 --> 12:37.920
He rushed off to Shunyi

12:37.920 --> 12:38.960
early in the morning,

12:39.000 --> 12:39.960
like something urgent came up.

13:02.040 --> 13:03.400
[The clothes are clean,]

13:04.040 --> 13:05.360
[with a scent of sunshine.]

13:07.960 --> 13:10.400
[It's a nice sunny day today.]

13:36.040 --> 13:36.760
Xia Luodi.

13:38.200 --> 13:39.080
Xia Luodi, you belong on the ground.

13:39.120 --> 13:40.200
What, aiming for the heavens now?

13:40.480 --> 13:41.560
That's your ID, right?

13:42.480 --> 13:43.640
I don't know what you're talking about.

13:43.920 --> 13:44.800
I didn't post

13:44.800 --> 13:45.640
those rumor threads.

13:46.040 --> 13:47.320
Did I say it was you?

13:47.880 --> 13:48.920
You're pretty self-aware.

13:51.520 --> 13:53.000
Don't accuse people randomly.

13:55.320 --> 13:56.320
That teddy bear

13:56.360 --> 13:57.320
on your avatar,

13:57.560 --> 13:59.040
why isn't it there today?

14:00.240 --> 14:01.040
Does what I hang

14:01.040 --> 14:01.800
concern you?

14:02.560 --> 14:03.480
Tough mouth.

14:04.400 --> 14:05.680
That's basically

14:05.920 --> 14:07.360
"Too guilty to deny it.'

14:13.400 --> 14:14.760
Don't think Xing Wu backing you up

14:14.840 --> 14:16.320
means you can slander people.

14:20.600 --> 14:21.600
I'm not like you.

14:22.520 --> 14:23.320
I don't play dirty tricks

14:23.320 --> 14:24.600
behind people's backs.

14:25.080 --> 14:26.080
If you don't like me

14:26.080 --> 14:26.760
and wanna beat me,

14:28.000 --> 14:29.320
then do it properly,

14:29.720 --> 14:31.240
let's compete in the next exam.

14:33.600 --> 14:34.160
Fine.

14:34.960 --> 14:36.040
Let everyone see

14:36.400 --> 14:37.760
who's got real ability

14:38.520 --> 14:39.920
and who's just bluffing.

14:40.560 --> 14:41.080
Deal.

14:41.840 --> 14:42.760
You set the bet.

14:47.120 --> 14:48.880
Loser runs ten laps.

14:49.720 --> 14:51.080
Ten laps?

14:53.760 --> 14:55.040
Don't dare?

14:56.960 --> 14:57.840
20 laps then.

14:58.480 --> 15:00.000
- 20 laps!
- Oh my!

15:00.000 --> 15:01.000
Go big or don't go.

15:03.360 --> 15:03.840
Deal.

15:04.120 --> 15:05.040
It's set.

15:08.680 --> 15:09.520
Not finished yet?

15:11.600 --> 15:12.240
Far from it.

15:22.240 --> 15:23.040
What do you want?

15:23.640 --> 15:24.760
Want you to delete some posts.

15:25.880 --> 15:26.680
Not urgent, 1,000.

15:26.840 --> 15:27.760
Express, 1,500.

15:28.560 --> 15:30.360
I'll give you 2,000. Do it fast.

15:35.080 --> 15:36.120
It's about Qing Ye.

15:37.320 --> 15:38.840
What's your relationship with her?

15:39.080 --> 15:40.240
Coming here just to help her delete posts?

15:40.720 --> 15:41.760
I'm her classmate.

15:42.640 --> 15:44.040
I just think she's a good person.

15:44.320 --> 15:45.160
I don't want her bullied

15:45.160 --> 15:45.960
or dragged through rumors

15:46.080 --> 15:46.760
at school.

15:47.760 --> 15:48.320
So,

15:48.680 --> 15:49.400
can you do it or not?

15:50.960 --> 15:51.800
I won't take this job.

15:51.960 --> 15:52.800
I'll pay more.

15:52.800 --> 15:54.320
Even that won't get me to take it.

15:58.120 --> 15:59.360
Aren't you her cousin?

15:59.440 --> 16:00.520
You won't even help her out?

16:02.360 --> 16:03.320
Not that I won't help.

16:04.120 --> 16:05.600
It's just not your place.

16:08.040 --> 16:09.080
Your brother told me to give this to you.

16:10.040 --> 16:10.760
Sorry for the trouble.

16:13.480 --> 16:14.520
Me and your brother, though

16:14.560 --> 16:15.640
met in prison,

16:16.320 --> 16:17.360
but he looked out for me.

16:17.640 --> 16:19.200
We're life-and-death brothers.

16:20.320 --> 16:22.000
Ping's sister is my sister.

16:22.560 --> 16:23.720
No need to be so formal.

16:27.320 --> 16:27.920
He…

16:28.480 --> 16:29.400
asked me to pass a message.

16:31.040 --> 16:32.560
He's been waiting for you to visit.

16:33.320 --> 16:34.320
If you're too busy,

16:34.320 --> 16:35.320
just write a letter.

16:35.920 --> 16:37.040
He's not my brother.

16:38.320 --> 16:39.400
If he hadn't gone to prison,

16:40.080 --> 16:41.360
I wouldn't be living

16:41.840 --> 16:42.680
under someone else's roof,

16:43.120 --> 16:43.880
getting side-eyes,

16:44.480 --> 16:45.760
and even being bullied at school.

16:47.080 --> 16:47.680
What's going on?

16:48.160 --> 16:49.000
Who bullied you?

17:17.319 --> 17:18.319
[If you don't want your brother's past]

17:18.319 --> 17:19.119
[to get out,]

17:19.800 --> 17:21.119
[stay away from Qing Ye.]

17:23.520 --> 17:24.160
Happy now?

17:27.000 --> 17:28.040
Uncle, you're back.

17:28.359 --> 17:29.320
What are you doing?

17:29.960 --> 17:30.840
Get back to work!

17:34.840 --> 17:35.760
Did you forget something?

17:45.720 --> 17:47.040
That's all the money?

17:54.320 --> 17:54.840
Come on,

17:55.040 --> 17:57.080
I'll take you out tomorrow.

18:34.040 --> 18:34.840
Ye,

18:34.920 --> 18:36.080
did you see it?

18:37.600 --> 18:38.240
See what?

18:38.400 --> 18:39.120
This.

18:53.360 --> 18:54.880
Who posted this?

18:55.400 --> 18:56.080
No idea.

18:59.320 --> 18:59.920
Ye.

19:07.440 --> 19:08.320
Did you see it?

19:09.560 --> 19:10.400
You posted this?

19:11.000 --> 19:11.680
Not me.

19:12.520 --> 19:13.880
I don't have the right to do that.

19:14.480 --> 19:15.440
I'd like to help you.

19:15.920 --> 19:16.880
But your brother said

19:17.200 --> 19:18.320
it's not my place.

19:24.000 --> 19:25.000
It's Wu.

19:36.760 --> 19:38.360
[Did you post the apology?]

19:39.040 --> 19:39.640
[No.]

19:42.320 --> 19:44.560
[Some people just won't admit it.]

19:50.920 --> 19:51.640
Wu,

19:52.680 --> 19:53.560
you've seemed

19:53.880 --> 19:55.520
a bit off lately.

19:59.320 --> 20:00.440
You've been

20:00.480 --> 20:01.440
pretty paranoid.

20:02.920 --> 20:03.760
Stop staring at me.

20:16.160 --> 20:17.400
Did you see the post?

20:17.480 --> 20:18.480
She already clarified it.

20:19.320 --> 20:20.320
I saw it.

20:20.360 --> 20:22.320
Who knows if it's true?

20:22.560 --> 20:23.440
Listen…

20:25.400 --> 20:27.840
People from big cities are sharp,

20:28.040 --> 20:29.000
better keep your distance.

20:31.520 --> 20:32.600
What class today?

20:33.400 --> 20:35.040
Stop gossiping.

20:35.360 --> 20:36.120
What, forget when you

20:36.120 --> 20:37.160
running your mouth about others?

20:38.920 --> 20:40.240
Getting bold now.

20:46.000 --> 20:47.320
Wait, aren't they…

20:50.960 --> 20:51.560
Take it.

20:52.800 --> 20:53.520
What for?

20:54.760 --> 20:55.880
At the cafeteria before,

20:56.040 --> 20:57.240
Cao Fan said you bullied me,

20:58.080 --> 20:59.520
I didn't explain it well.

21:00.360 --> 21:01.120
So this is…

21:04.080 --> 21:05.760
Are you apologizing to me?

21:08.480 --> 21:09.320
You really talk

21:09.360 --> 21:10.240
that bluntly?

21:10.320 --> 21:11.520
No tact at all.

21:13.160 --> 21:15.320
I'm just blunt.

21:15.640 --> 21:17.160
I don't sugarcoat things.

21:20.600 --> 21:21.240
Alright.

21:21.320 --> 21:22.320
I admit it I'm apologizing.

21:22.360 --> 21:23.360
I messed up sorry,

21:23.400 --> 21:24.000
I own it.

21:25.760 --> 21:26.760
But that doesn't mean

21:27.560 --> 21:28.720
I wanna be friends with you.

21:31.360 --> 21:32.240
What's so funny?

21:33.160 --> 21:33.800
Stop laughing.

21:33.800 --> 21:35.560
I'm laughing because
you're pretty interesting.

21:35.720 --> 21:36.680
Do people here

21:36.880 --> 21:37.760
all like

21:37.760 --> 21:38.760
saying one thing and meaning another?

21:39.680 --> 21:41.000
Saying one thing and meaning another?

21:41.640 --> 21:42.800
I don't do that.

21:45.440 --> 21:46.240
I'd like to know

21:46.720 --> 21:48.200
who's being two-faced.

21:49.200 --> 21:49.840
Tell me.

21:51.760 --> 21:52.480
Didn't expect that, right?

21:53.160 --> 21:53.960
Yeah, I didn't.

21:59.920 --> 22:00.640
Just now…

22:35.280 --> 22:36.960
[Auntie, I've got a mock exam today.]

22:37.160 --> 22:38.240
[I'm off to school.]

22:45.920 --> 22:46.640
Qing Ye?

22:48.480 --> 22:49.120
I'm not.

22:53.960 --> 22:55.080
Who are you?

22:55.120 --> 22:56.000
What do you want?

22:56.400 --> 22:57.560
I'm in a hurry today.

22:57.760 --> 22:59.080
Can we talk another time?

23:04.680 --> 23:05.560
Everybody find

23:05.640 --> 23:06.640
your seats.

23:07.440 --> 23:08.360
No, we can't.

23:08.840 --> 23:10.120
Who we are doesn't matter.

23:10.520 --> 23:11.480
What matters is

23:12.480 --> 23:13.520
Gang's gonna

23:13.520 --> 23:14.560
teach you a lesson.

23:15.320 --> 23:17.040
I don't know any Gang!

23:18.040 --> 23:19.000
Listen up,

23:19.200 --> 23:20.600
this is Xingfu Third Street,

23:21.040 --> 23:21.760
less than 300 meters

23:21.760 --> 23:22.680
from my brother's shop.

23:23.240 --> 23:24.600
You dare stop me here?

23:25.000 --> 23:26.320
Aren't you afraid my brother'll
beat you up?

23:27.200 --> 23:27.920
Your brother?

23:28.080 --> 23:29.320
Who the hell is he?

23:29.600 --> 23:30.720
You think we're scared of him?

23:34.200 --> 23:35.000
Where's Qing Ye?

23:45.440 --> 23:46.920
What exactly do you want?

23:47.400 --> 23:48.400
What do you think?

23:48.880 --> 23:49.800
Money?

23:50.080 --> 23:50.800
I'll give you anything

23:50.800 --> 23:52.160
you want.

23:52.560 --> 23:53.840
Well then, we'll help ourselves.

23:59.560 --> 24:01.040
Let go of me!

24:18.200 --> 24:19.120
Where you running?

24:19.240 --> 24:19.880
Keep running!

24:20.360 --> 24:22.040
What do you want?

24:22.200 --> 24:23.400
Weren't you in a rush for school?

24:23.720 --> 24:25.080
Didn't even bring your bag?

24:25.240 --> 24:26.080
Don't come closer!

24:26.360 --> 24:27.400
Straight-A kid,

24:27.680 --> 24:29.440
what goodies you hiding in that bag?

24:30.200 --> 24:32.040
What the hell do you want?

24:32.480 --> 24:33.960
Let's see where you run now.

24:43.120 --> 24:44.640
Go, take your exam.

24:44.840 --> 24:45.520
What about you?

24:45.720 --> 24:46.320
Run!

24:50.320 --> 24:51.360
Go, I've got this.

25:07.840 --> 25:09.080
Exam's over.

25:09.680 --> 25:10.960
Stop writing, put your pens down.

25:30.760 --> 25:31.320
Bro.

25:31.640 --> 25:32.320
Wait,

25:33.040 --> 25:34.000
you got beaten up

25:34.000 --> 25:34.960
by a girl like this?

25:35.200 --> 25:35.920
No,

25:36.200 --> 25:37.000
it was Xing Wu.

25:37.160 --> 25:38.000
Xing Wu?

25:47.080 --> 25:48.240
My dear old pal!

25:48.400 --> 25:49.920
Our regular…

25:52.400 --> 25:53.600
Come at me.

25:53.600 --> 25:54.440
My haircut!

25:54.960 --> 25:56.040
Yang Gang, listen up.

25:56.640 --> 25:58.320
Don't touch people you shouldn't!

26:05.120 --> 26:05.960
Xing Wu.

26:06.120 --> 26:06.960
Tell the police.

26:06.960 --> 26:08.800
So that's your game?

26:11.440 --> 26:12.560
- Don't move!
- All of you!

26:13.040 --> 26:14.120
- Freeze!
- What are you doing?

26:14.160 --> 26:14.760
Hands on your head!

26:15.080 --> 26:15.800
- Get down!
- Hands on your head!

26:15.800 --> 26:16.440
Officer Xu.

26:16.920 --> 26:17.440
Don't run!

26:17.640 --> 26:18.200
Stop right there!

26:18.200 --> 26:18.760
Yang Gang,

26:19.040 --> 26:20.200
it's you again.

26:20.560 --> 26:21.880
I'm innocent.

26:22.160 --> 26:23.240
Still lying?

26:24.000 --> 26:24.960
To be honest,

26:25.080 --> 26:26.520
we've been watching you
for a long time.

26:26.840 --> 26:28.000
Caught you red-handed.

26:28.240 --> 26:29.320
What else can you say?

26:29.640 --> 26:30.680
This isn't mine!

26:30.680 --> 26:31.240
Enough!

26:31.600 --> 26:32.400
Cut the crap!

26:32.680 --> 26:33.720
Talk at the station!

26:33.920 --> 26:34.520
Take him away!

26:34.840 --> 26:35.760
- Get up!
- Get up!

26:36.840 --> 26:37.320
Move!

26:37.880 --> 26:38.360
Move!

26:38.600 --> 26:39.080
Get up!

26:39.400 --> 26:40.160
Don't think you can

26:40.240 --> 26:41.360
protect your sister forever.

26:42.360 --> 26:43.200
What are you mumbling?

26:43.840 --> 26:44.360
Move!

26:44.560 --> 26:45.840
- Move!
- Coming.

27:11.920 --> 27:12.680
How'd the exam go?

27:13.120 --> 27:13.760
Did you make it?

27:14.520 --> 27:15.880
Missed English this morning.

27:18.600 --> 27:19.360
That'll hit

27:19.400 --> 27:20.440
your score hard, right?

27:22.320 --> 27:23.960
It's fine, just a monthly test.

27:24.480 --> 27:25.040
Doesn't matter.

27:25.320 --> 27:25.880
Really?

27:27.080 --> 27:27.600
Really.

27:29.280 --> 27:30.320
You're not hurt, right?

27:32.000 --> 27:33.360
Do I look hurt?

27:33.440 --> 27:34.000
No.

27:34.720 --> 27:35.440
Good.

27:36.200 --> 27:36.760
How about you?

27:37.480 --> 27:38.120
You were pretty scared

27:38.560 --> 27:39.320
this morning, weren't you?

27:41.640 --> 27:42.480
Not at all.

27:46.760 --> 27:47.360
Yeah,

27:47.800 --> 27:49.120
I was panicked at first.

27:50.400 --> 27:51.760
But then I thought it through,

27:52.360 --> 27:53.440
I was pretty brave,

27:53.800 --> 27:54.400
wasn't I?

27:55.600 --> 27:56.120
Yeah.

27:57.040 --> 27:58.560
Smart and brave.

28:00.560 --> 28:01.240
But,

28:01.440 --> 28:02.960
next time this happens,

28:03.320 --> 28:04.600
run forward and don't look back.

28:05.160 --> 28:05.880
You need to learn to protect yourself

28:05.920 --> 28:07.000
when I'm not around.

28:07.360 --> 28:08.320
I did run.

28:08.640 --> 28:10.080
Not into a dead end.

28:10.160 --> 28:10.800
So sometimes

28:10.840 --> 28:12.000
I still need you.

28:26.320 --> 28:27.040
Let's go home.

28:45.440 --> 28:46.080
Hold tight.

29:10.960 --> 29:11.680
[Don't think]

29:11.680 --> 29:12.960
[you can protect your sister forever.]

29:19.600 --> 29:20.320
[Xing Wu,]

29:21.200 --> 29:22.600
[come back to school with me.]

29:25.560 --> 29:26.920
[If you come back with me,]

29:27.400 --> 29:29.000
[no one will dare bully me.]

29:30.520 --> 29:31.960
[Not even for my protection?]

31:12.560 --> 31:15.080
[This year's Youth Model
Aircraft Competition,]

31:15.240 --> 31:17.520
[Zhazhating Cup winner]

31:17.880 --> 31:18.800
[goes to Xing Wu!]

31:35.920 --> 31:38.160
[Gold Award Winner of the Anzi County]

31:38.240 --> 31:39.560
[Technology Innovation Competition:]

31:39.880 --> 31:41.040
[Xing Wu!]

32:12.880 --> 32:14.120
[Champion of the First]

32:14.160 --> 32:16.560
[Zhazhating Paper Airplane
Flying Competition:]

32:16.880 --> 32:17.880
[Xing Wu!]

33:12.360 --> 33:13.080
Move!

33:13.120 --> 33:14.720
Excuse me!

33:14.880 --> 33:16.160
Move it!

33:16.200 --> 33:17.320
You two and your scores,

33:17.320 --> 33:18.200
what's the point of even looking?

33:20.600 --> 33:22.200
I thought Qing Ye was amazing,

33:22.520 --> 33:23.560
just so-so.

33:24.480 --> 33:26.160
Total 549.

33:26.680 --> 33:28.080
Chinese 140.

33:28.400 --> 33:30.560
Math 145.

33:30.720 --> 33:31.760
English…

33:32.080 --> 33:34.200
Qing Ye missed English.

33:35.560 --> 33:36.440
One subject missing,

33:36.480 --> 33:37.800
still way ahead of me.

33:38.080 --> 33:39.120
Who knows her real score?

33:39.120 --> 33:39.520
Don't worry,

33:39.520 --> 33:40.600
I'm below you.

33:41.080 --> 33:42.560
Then she needs to add the English score

33:42.600 --> 33:43.880
to get the real level.

33:44.600 --> 33:45.360
For example,

33:45.520 --> 33:46.720
say 120 in English.

33:46.880 --> 33:48.320
Total 549,

33:48.680 --> 33:49.760
one times one is one,
two times one is two.

33:49.760 --> 33:50.600
Six…

33:51.440 --> 33:52.560
669.

33:53.680 --> 33:54.360
That much?

33:55.800 --> 33:57.160
That's basically first place!

34:00.720 --> 34:01.440
Where's Qing Ye?

34:01.680 --> 34:02.600
Why isn't she here?

34:03.400 --> 34:04.640
She's on the field!

34:18.360 --> 34:19.600
My cousin's amazing.

34:20.159 --> 34:21.239
She could've won,

34:21.960 --> 34:22.719
but she gave up.

34:41.320 --> 34:42.520
She's really running.

34:45.560 --> 34:47.159
My idol Qing Ye.

34:48.000 --> 34:50.000
Even missing one subject,
she's still top ten.

34:50.760 --> 34:52.600
Missing two and

34:52.639 --> 34:53.760
we might still lose to her.

35:39.720 --> 35:40.560
Come on!

35:40.600 --> 35:42.160
Qing Ye, go!

35:42.200 --> 35:44.800
Qing Ye, go!

35:44.880 --> 35:45.960
Go cousin!

35:46.320 --> 35:48.680
- Come on!
- Come on!

35:48.760 --> 35:50.000
Qing Ye, go!

35:50.320 --> 35:51.560
Qing Ye, go!

35:51.560 --> 35:53.400
Qing Ye, go!

35:53.800 --> 35:54.480
Qing Ye!

35:57.560 --> 35:58.320
Come on.

36:00.800 --> 36:01.560
Run forward.

36:02.040 --> 36:02.760
Catch up.

36:06.920 --> 36:08.680
- Qing Ye!
- Go!

36:20.480 --> 36:22.080
- Qing Ye!
- Go!

36:22.440 --> 36:23.680
- Come on!
- Come on!

36:23.920 --> 36:25.720
- Come on!
- Come on!

36:29.680 --> 36:31.360
["Every cloud has a silver lining."]

36:32.320 --> 36:33.200
[What does it mean?]

36:35.720 --> 36:36.760
[British idiom.]

36:37.120 --> 36:38.080
[It means]

36:38.520 --> 36:39.880
[something gloomy]

36:40.400 --> 36:41.320
[might hide]

36:41.320 --> 36:42.360
[a bright side.]

36:44.840 --> 36:45.400
[It will.]

36:58.600 --> 37:00.760
[Life is full of cracks,]

37:01.440 --> 37:02.160
[because that's]

37:02.160 --> 37:03.480
[where the light gets in.]

37:04.880 --> 37:06.880
[No storm lasts forever.]

37:07.720 --> 37:09.280
[And the sun will always]

37:09.280 --> 37:10.760
[rise again each day.]

37:21.160 --> 37:21.840
Class.

37:22.880 --> 37:23.640
Today our class

37:23.680 --> 37:24.920
has a new transfer student.

37:25.960 --> 37:26.640
Come in.

37:32.400 --> 37:33.360
Who's that? You know him?

37:33.440 --> 37:34.240
Xing Wu.

37:34.320 --> 37:35.320
I heard he used

37:35.360 --> 37:36.200
to ace math

37:36.480 --> 37:37.120
and won lots of

37:37.120 --> 37:38.200
model aircraft championships.

37:38.320 --> 37:39.880
I believe some of you

37:40.240 --> 37:41.760
already know him.

37:42.400 --> 37:43.680
Some of you might even

37:43.720 --> 37:45.040
have heard about his stories.

37:45.680 --> 37:47.000
Go ahead and introduce yourself.

37:47.560 --> 37:48.600
Hi, I'm Xing Wu.

37:53.040 --> 37:53.640
That's it?

37:54.080 --> 37:54.720
That's it.

37:56.240 --> 37:57.600
Alright, cut the noise.

37:58.760 --> 37:59.520
We have less than

37:59.520 --> 38:00.360
a year left

38:00.680 --> 38:01.400
to prep for the gaokao.

38:01.840 --> 38:03.120
I want you all

38:03.320 --> 38:05.240
to learn from each other and get along.

38:05.840 --> 38:06.400
Xing Wu,

38:06.760 --> 38:07.880
sit in that empty seat.

38:10.040 --> 38:11.240
Alright, class start.

38:16.760 --> 38:19.360
Turn to page seven.

38:20.160 --> 38:21.600
Back without a word?

38:27.600 --> 38:28.360
[Welcome back.]

38:29.720 --> 38:31.240
[Everyone's curious]

38:31.600 --> 38:33.200
[why you suddenly changed your mind]

38:33.200 --> 38:33.840
[and came back to school.]

38:33.840 --> 38:35.320
Function analysis

38:35.320 --> 38:37.320
and derivative applications.

38:37.840 --> 38:38.800
Take a look

38:38.800 --> 38:39.560
at this problem

38:39.880 --> 38:41.600
and think through the solution.

38:41.600 --> 38:42.640
Ask me if you're stuck.

38:51.880 --> 38:53.000
Just to get a high school diploma.

39:00.480 --> 39:01.240
Do you know?

39:01.480 --> 39:02.760
Xing Wu is in our class.

39:03.320 --> 39:03.880
Xing Wu?

39:04.200 --> 39:05.600
You don't know him?

39:05.840 --> 39:06.920
I've heard about

39:06.920 --> 39:07.840
lots of gossip about him.

39:08.160 --> 39:09.320
Seeing him in person,

39:09.480 --> 39:11.560
he's like a total movie star!

39:11.960 --> 39:12.600
Shallow.

39:12.760 --> 39:13.920
He's not just handsome,

39:14.320 --> 39:15.040
but also

39:16.200 --> 39:17.320
very manly.

39:20.000 --> 39:22.160
And I've got some hot news.

39:22.880 --> 39:24.440
Qing Ye and Xing Wu

39:24.960 --> 39:26.520
are actually cousins.

39:26.960 --> 39:28.000
I already knew.

39:28.800 --> 39:29.880
Why don't I have

39:29.960 --> 39:31.520
a cousin like that?

39:31.680 --> 39:32.920
Don't tell me you like him.

39:33.160 --> 39:34.240
Of course I do.

39:34.560 --> 39:36.080
He's handsome,

39:36.080 --> 39:37.160
he plays basketball,

39:37.240 --> 39:38.640
and protects his sister.

39:38.800 --> 39:40.240
Totally my type.

39:40.480 --> 39:41.200
Like someone

39:41.200 --> 39:42.200
out of a drama.

39:42.320 --> 39:43.000
Don't you think so?

39:43.560 --> 39:44.360
I don't.

39:44.800 --> 39:46.040
He was expelled before.

39:46.160 --> 39:47.240
What's there to like?

39:47.480 --> 39:48.520
No!

39:48.520 --> 39:49.320
I heard he used to

39:49.320 --> 39:50.520
have great grades!

39:50.840 --> 39:52.000
He got bullied by thugs

39:52.040 --> 39:53.160
and got punished for it.

39:53.200 --> 39:54.520
He took a leave himself.

40:00.440 --> 40:01.520
Thanks, Mr. Zhu.

40:01.600 --> 40:02.040
No problem.

40:02.040 --> 40:02.640
Liu Nian!

40:03.200 --> 40:04.120
Come help me with the stuff!

40:04.240 --> 40:05.080
Coming!

40:05.440 --> 40:05.960
I got it.

40:06.000 --> 40:06.880
- Here.
- Mr. Zhu.

40:06.960 --> 40:08.080
- Mr. Zhu.
- Let me.

40:08.200 --> 40:08.640
Yeah.

40:08.960 --> 40:09.440
Alright.

40:09.480 --> 40:10.600
Liu Nian's got it.

40:11.120 --> 40:12.440
Really appreciate it, Mr. Zhu.

40:12.640 --> 40:13.560
You even drove me back.

40:13.760 --> 40:14.120
Well,

40:14.200 --> 40:15.480
I'm just happy Xing Wu's back.

40:16.120 --> 40:17.120
Speaking of him,

40:17.320 --> 40:18.600
I really owe you one.

40:18.640 --> 40:19.960
Without your help,

40:20.000 --> 40:21.560
he wouldn't have made it back

40:21.600 --> 40:22.680
to class so smoothly.

40:23.760 --> 40:24.520
It's nothing.

40:24.520 --> 40:25.440
No worries.

40:26.160 --> 40:27.960
Oh come on, don't say that.

40:28.480 --> 40:29.160
Mr. Zhu,

40:29.320 --> 40:30.040
take this.

40:30.400 --> 40:31.200
A voucher.

40:31.400 --> 40:31.880
No!

40:31.960 --> 40:33.840
Take it. Come to my shop anytime,

40:33.920 --> 40:36.160
haircuts, washes, perms,

40:36.160 --> 40:36.600
all discounted.

40:36.600 --> 40:37.320
Wait, Lanfang,

40:37.320 --> 40:38.240
it's not easy running a business.

40:38.240 --> 40:38.880
I can't take this.

40:38.920 --> 40:40.640
But you always help me out.

40:40.680 --> 40:42.000
I'd feel even worse.

40:42.000 --> 40:43.000
Just take it.

40:43.600 --> 40:44.640
Come by Xuan Island anytime.

40:44.960 --> 40:45.320
Alright then.

40:45.320 --> 40:46.240
I've got class later,

40:46.240 --> 40:46.880
I'll head back.

40:47.000 --> 40:47.400
Alright.

40:47.440 --> 40:47.960
Thanks.

40:48.400 --> 40:49.080
He got a voucher.

40:50.400 --> 40:51.240
We didn't get one!

40:51.320 --> 40:52.200
Yeah!

40:52.400 --> 40:52.960
Take care.

40:53.000 --> 40:53.440
Bye.

40:57.360 --> 40:59.680
Mr. Zhu is seriously amazing!

40:59.920 --> 41:02.200
Not only got Wu back to school,

41:02.320 --> 41:03.520
he even drove

41:03.520 --> 41:04.680
our Lanfang home!

41:04.760 --> 41:06.760
People who don't know

41:06.960 --> 41:07.880
would think he's her man,

41:08.000 --> 41:09.200
not a teacher.

41:10.520 --> 41:11.880
You two.

41:12.160 --> 41:13.840
Just enjoy your watermelon.

41:14.040 --> 41:15.680
We're already eating your drama!

41:15.720 --> 41:16.320
We are!

41:16.320 --> 41:17.200
I've got mine too.

41:17.920 --> 41:18.880
Yeah, I've got mine.

41:22.680 --> 41:23.240
Leg hurts?

41:32.880 --> 41:34.080
Why'd you pinch me?

41:34.720 --> 41:35.720
I just wanted to see

41:36.600 --> 41:37.800
if this is real.

41:38.200 --> 41:39.400
It doesn't feel real.

41:39.880 --> 41:41.880
You're in uniform,

41:42.400 --> 41:43.360
and we're walking home

41:43.400 --> 41:44.680
together.

41:45.400 --> 41:47.320
Feels kind of surreal.

41:48.040 --> 41:48.920
Then should I

41:49.280 --> 41:50.360
flick your forehead

41:51.040 --> 41:52.720
to make it more real?

41:54.040 --> 41:54.760
No,

41:54.840 --> 41:55.320
I'm good.

41:55.360 --> 41:56.560
It feels real enough now.

41:56.680 --> 41:57.360
Not a dream.

41:57.440 --> 41:58.160
Definitely not a dream!

41:58.160 --> 41:58.960
It's me.

41:59.040 --> 42:00.200
I need confirmation.

42:01.240 --> 42:02.200
I think I'm dreaming.

42:02.200 --> 42:03.080
You are not.

42:03.120 --> 42:03.800
I have…

42:03.800 --> 42:04.520
- Let me test it.
- confirmed it.

42:04.640 --> 42:05.160
No!

42:05.160 --> 42:06.320
Let me see if I'm dreaming.

42:06.480 --> 42:07.640
Anyway, I'm not dreaming.

42:18.520 --> 42:19.120
Wake up?

42:19.720 --> 42:20.320
Yeah.

42:20.960 --> 42:21.760
Totally awake.

42:26.000 --> 42:27.080
Hop on, I'll carry you.

42:30.680 --> 42:32.400
I'm fine, I can walk.

42:33.960 --> 42:35.200
You're too slow,

42:35.400 --> 42:36.440
we'll miss the bus.

42:36.880 --> 42:37.440
Come on.

42:50.120 --> 42:51.320
If I'm too heavy,

42:51.480 --> 42:52.760
just put me down.

42:54.440 --> 42:54.880
You're fine.

42:55.520 --> 42:57.240
Lighter than a gas can and a sea fish.

42:59.840 --> 43:00.840
Still holding a grudge?

43:01.520 --> 43:02.640
I just remember things well.

43:18.720 --> 43:19.360
Does your forehead hurt?

43:39.320 --> 43:41.240
Thanks for Mr. Zhu's help,

43:42.040 --> 43:43.440
he talked to the principal

43:43.440 --> 43:44.200
and said you're

43:44.200 --> 43:45.480
a promising student.

43:45.960 --> 43:47.280
Otherwise, coming back to school

43:47.640 --> 43:48.720
would've been a hassle.
